      "nodeId": "understanding.book.nora.custody.20260927",
      "disposition": "valid; inquiry partly answered by new fiction",
      "reason": "Henry has an attraction to the drawings and a moment of technical company, beyond being an ethical custodian. His separate life, Babbage's impatient final question and the lack of permanent cure are retained. No concluding thesis added."
    },
    {
      "nodeId": "understanding.book.nora.margaret.20260927",
      "disposition": "valid as prior inquiry; partly answered by new fiction",
      "reason": "Margaret's own account line is preserved. Her later request changes a small choice—Edward stays for shared reading—without making her lecture him or changing the financial decision. The note's original statement that the inquiry is not yet canon belongs to its earlier authoring time; record the answer as a new development rather than overwriting it."
    }
  ]
}
